// arch batch 10 — smallthinker / llada-moe / minimax-01 / graniteswitch
//
//   * smallthinker  — src/models/smallthinker.cpp:66-189 (probs_in + ReGLU MoE,
//     the optional iswa graph template, the n_no_rope_layer_step rope skip)
//   * llada-moe     — src/models/llada-moe.cpp:54-163 (the non-causal diffusion
//     attention over build_attn_inp_no_cache — no KV cache in the graph)
//   * minimax-01    — src/models/minimax-01.cpp:192-484 (lightning attention:
//     the llm_graph_input_la decay inputs + the n_embd_head_la recurrent state
//     + GGML_UNARY_OP_EXP)
//   * graniteswitch — src/models/granite-switch.cpp:221-427 (the in-graph
//     adapter router + the per-token switched LoRA deltas)
// ======================================================================

