//     score-correction bias + the always-on shared expert, softplus
//     attention output gate in two widths, per-head q/k norms, per-layer
//     head counts, optional hybrid full/SWA with per-layer-type RoPE —
//     YaRN on the full layers, plain rope on the SWA layers)
//   * maple    — src/models/maple.cpp:65-150 (softmax MoE over the iswa
//     pair; rope runs on the SWA layers only, with the *_swa frequencies
//     and n_rot_swa — the full-attention layers never rotate)
// ======================================================================

